{"id": "ab648f7f-04f3-4da9-8072-cdd810aec595", "slug": "pricing-recreaton", "title": "Pricing Recreaton", "description": "Recreaton Elevate Pricing Section is designed for comparing plans and supporting conversion decisions. Key features include plan comparison blocks and conversion-oriented actions. It is suitable for subscription pricing pages and plan comparison experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Pricing Recreaton\"\ndescription: \"Recreaton Elevate Pricing Section is designed for comparing plans and supporting conversion decisions. Key features include plan comparison blocks and conversion-oriented actions. It is suitable for subscription pricing pages and plan comparison experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#D946EF\"\n  secondary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  accent: \"#A855F7\"\n  background: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  surface: \"#2D1657\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#E5E7EB\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"1px\"\n  control: \"1px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Pricing Recreaton\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Sourany Phomhome (@sou). Views: 25; favorites: 5; remixes: 1.\nTags: pricing, section, animated, cta, billing.\n## Overview\nRecreaton Elevate Pricing Section is designed for comparing plans and supporting conversion decisions. Key features include plan comparison blocks and conversion-oriented actions. It is suitable for subscription pricing pages and plan comparison experiences.\n\nElevate your workflow today. $10 /month (billed annually) Networked note-taking End to end encryption Chrome and Safari web clipper Kindle highlights sync Kindle offline sync iOS app Start your 14-day trial\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Elevate your workflow today..\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #D946EF, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #A855F7, background #FFFFFF, surface #2D1657, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Pricing Recreaton</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <script>\n        tailwind.config = {\n            theme: {\n                extend: {\n                    fontFamily: {\n                        sans: ['Inter', 'sans-serif'],\n                    },\n                    colors: {\n                        brand: {\n                            bg: '#03010a',\n                            glow: '#d946ef',\n                            moon: '#a855f7',\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    </script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-brand-bg text-white font-sans antialiased overflow-x-hidden min-h-screen relative selection:bg-fuchsia-500/30\">\n\n    <!-- Skill Directive: Container Lines -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none flex justify-center\">\n        <div class=\"w-full max-w-6xl h-full border-x border-white/[0.03] relative\">\n            <!-- Corner Squares -->\n            <div class=\"absolute -top-1 -left-1 w-2 h-2 bg-brand-bg border border-white/20\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute -top-1 -right-1 w-2 h-2 bg-brand-bg border border-white/20\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute -bottom-1 -left-1 w-2 h-2 bg-brand-bg border border-white/20\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute -bottom-1 -right-1 w-2 h-2 bg-brand-bg border border-white/20\"></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Main Scroll Container -->\n    <main class=\"relative z-10 w-full min-h-screen flex flex-col items-center\">\n\n        <!-- Skill Directive: Masked Reveal Heading -->\n        <section class=\"w-full pt-32 pb-16 flex justify-center\">\n            <h1 id=\"reveal-heading\" class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-x-2 text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-medium tracking-tight text-white/90\">\n                <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-flex\"><span class=\"reveal-word inline-block translate-y-full opacity-0\">Elevate</span></span>\n                <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-flex\"><span class=\"reveal-word inline-block translate-y-full opacity-0\">your</span></span>\n                <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-flex\"><span class=\"reveal-word inline-block translate-y-full opacity-0\">workflow</span></span>\n                <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-flex\"><span class=\"reveal-word inline-block translate-y-full opacity-0\">today.</span></span>\n            </h1>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Pricing Section -->\n        <section class=\"relative w-full max-w-5xl mx-auto flex flex-col items-center pb-40\">\n\n            <!-- Background Visuals: Mask Moon & Sparkles -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-[8%] left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[800px] sm:w-[1000px] h-[800px] sm:h-[1000px] pointer-events-none flex flex-col items-center z-0\">\n\n                <!-- The \"Mask Moon\" Container -->\n                <div class=\"relative w-full h-full rounded-full overflow-hidden\"\n                     style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 -40px 100px -20px rgba(168,85,247,0.4), inset 0 -20px 40px -10px rgba(217,70,239,0.3);\">\n\n                    <!-- Circular Pink Gradient with Subtle Fade -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-60 mix-blend-screen\"\n                         style=\"background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 85%, rgba(217,70,239,0.5) 0%, rgba(168,85,247,0.2) 40%, transparent 75%);\"></div>\n\n                    <!-- Faux 3D Globe SVG Lines -->\n                    <svg class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full opacity-30 mix-blend-overlay\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 400\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.6)\" stroke-width=\"0.3\">\n                        <!-- Horizontal curves -->\n                        <path d=\"M -50 150 Q 200 230 450 150\" />\n                        <path d=\"M -50 210 Q 200 310 450 210\" />\n                        <path d=\"M -50 270 Q 200 390 450 270\" />\n                        <path d=\"M -50 330 Q 200 470 450 330\" />\n                        <!-- Vertical curves -->\n                        <path d=\"M 200 -50 L 200 450\" />\n                        <path d=\"M 200 -50 Q 120 200 140 450\" />\n                        <path d=\"M 200 -50 Q 280 200 260 450\" />\n                        <path d=\"M 200 -50 Q 40 200 80 450\" />\n                        <path d=\"M 200 -50 Q 360 200 320 450\" />\n                        <path d=\"M 200 -50 Q -40 200 20 450\" />\n                        <path d=\"M 200 -50 Q 440 200 380 450\" />\n                    </svg>\n\n                    <!-- Sparkles Layer -->\n                    <div id=\"sparkles-container\" class=\"absolute inset-0\"></div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Bright Bottom Edge Rim Highlight -->\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 rounded-full border-b-[2px] border-fuchsia-400/60 mix-blend-screen\"\n                     style=\"clip-path: polygon(0 60%, 100% 60%, 100% 100%, 0 100%); box-shadow: 0 20px 60px -10px rgba(217,70,239,0.4);\"></div>\n\n                <!-- Floor Reflection -->\n                <div class=\"absolute top-[90%] left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[700px] h-[300px] rounded-[100%] bg-fuchsia-600/30 blur-[60px] opacity-40\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute top-[92%] left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[400px] h-[150px] rounded-[100%] bg-purple-500/40 blur-[40px] opacity-50 mix-blend-screen\"></div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Foreground Content -->\n            <div class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col items-center w-full px-6 pt-10\">\n\n                <!-- Price Header -->\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-16 sm:mb-20\">\n                    <span class=\"text-7xl sm:text-[6rem] leading-none font-semibold tracking-tighter text-white drop-shadow-md\">$10</span>\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm text-slate-400/90 font-normal tracking-wide\">\n                        <span>/month</span>\n                        <span>(billed annually)</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Features Grid -->\n                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-x-12 sm:gap-x-20 gap-y-6 sm:gap-y-8 mb-16 sm:mb-20 w-full max-w-2xl mx-auto\">\n                    <!-- Feature 1 -->\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center w-[22px] h-[22px] rounded-md bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.08] shadow-[inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.05)]\">\n                            <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-white/90 rotate-45 rounded-[1px]\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                        <span class=\"text-sm text-slate-200 font-normal\">Networked note-taking</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <!-- Feature 2 -->\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center w-[22px] h-[22px] rounded-md bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.08] shadow-[inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.05)]\">\n                            <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-white/90 rotate-45 rounded-[1px]\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                        <span class=\"text-sm text-slate-200 font-normal\">End to end encryption</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <!-- Feature 3 -->\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center w-[22px] h-[22px] rounded-md bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.08] shadow-[inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.05)]\">\n                            <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-white/90 rotate-45 rounded-[1px]\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                        <span class=\"text-sm text-slate-200 font-normal\">Chrome and Safari web clipper</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <!-- Feature 4 -->\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center w-[22px] h-[22px] rounded-md bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.08] shadow-[inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.05)]\">\n                            <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-white/90 rotate-45 rounded-[1px]\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                        <span class=\"text-sm text-slate-200 font-normal\">Kindle highlights sync</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <!-- Feature 5 -->\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center w-[22px] h-[22px] rounded-md bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.08] shadow-[inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.05)]\">\n                            <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-white/90 rotate-45 rounded-[1px]\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                        <span class=\"text-sm text-slate-200 font-normal\">Kindle offline sync</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <!-- Feature 6 -->\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center w-[22px] h-[22px] rounded-md bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.08] shadow-[inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.05)]\">\n                            <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-white/90 rotate-45 rounded-[1px]\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                        <span class=\"text-sm text-slate-200 font-normal\">iOS app</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- CTA Button -->\n                <button class=\"px-6 py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-[#211040] border border-purple-500/40 text-sm font-normal text-white/95 shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(168,85,247,0.15)] hover:bg-[#2d1657] hover:border-purple-400/60 transition-all duration-300\">\n                    Start your 14-day trial\n                </button>\n\n            </div>\n        </section>\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        // Wait for DOM\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", (event) => {\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            // --- Skill Directive: Masked Staggered Word Reveal ---\n            const words = document.querySelectorAll('.reveal-word');\n            gsap.to(words, {\n                y: \"0%\",\n                opacity: 1,\n                duration: 1,\n                ease: \"power4.out\",\n                stagger: 0.1,\n                scrollTrigger: {\n                    trigger: \"#reveal-heading\",\n                    start: \"top 80%\",\n                    toggleActions: \"play none none reverse\"\n                }\n            });\n\n            // --- Animate Sparkles from Bottom to Top ---\n            const container = document.getElementById('sparkles-container');\n            const sparkleCount = 60;\n\n            for (let i = 0; i < sparkleCount; i++) {\n                const sparkle = document.createElement('div');\n                // Randomly assign small dot or tiny star look\n                const isStar = Math.random() > 0.7;\n                sparkle.className = `absolute rounded-full bg-white ${isStar ? 'w-1 h-1 shadow-[0_0_4px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.8)]' : 'w-[2px] h-[2px]'} sparkle-el`;\n\n                // Start positions anywhere in the circle horizontally, but concentrated towards the bottom vertically\n                const left = Math.random() * 100;\n                // Distribute starting Y heavily towards the bottom half\n                const startYOffset = 50 + (Math.random() * 60);\n\n                sparkle.style.left = `${left}%`;\n                sparkle.style.top = `${startYOffset}%`;\n\n                container.appendChild(sparkle);\n\n                // GSAP Animation for subtle fade and upward movement\n                gsap.to(sparkle, {\n                    y: () => -(300 + Math.random() * 400), // Move up significantly\n                    duration: () => 4 + Math.random() * 5, // Random slow speed\n                    repeat: -1,\n                    delay: () => Math.random() * 5,\n                    ease: \"none\", // Linear float\n                    keyframes: {\n                        // Opacity reduce fade per requirements\n                        \"0%\":   { opacity: 0, scale: 0.5 },\n                        \"20%\":  { opacity: 0.8, scale: 1 },\n                        \"70%\":  { opacity: 0.3, scale: 0.8 },\n                        \"100%\": { opacity: 0, scale: 0.5 }\n                    }\n                });\n            }\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "pricing-recreaton.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/pricing-recreaton.jpg", "source_name": "pricing-recreaton-DESIGN.md", "views": 89, "forks": 3, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "8bd0314a-9525-4a13-996e-2c37cbd9e514", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T08:43:41.763008+00:00"}